# GitHub

- CI runs on `windows-latest` with .NET 10 and the MAUI workload. Build library + tests; sample only as `net10.0-windows`.
- Pack and push NuGet only from `v*` tags (`pack.yml`).
- Labels live in `.github/labels.yml` (`skip-delete: true`). Do not invent one-off label names when a taxonomy label fits.
- Package id on nuget.org is `SmartImage.Maui`.
